export anchor Inset:
    description:
        Shorthand for top, right, bottom and left. Values map onto the sides the same way as margin: one value sets all sides; two set top/bottom then left/right; three set top, left/right, bottom; four set top, right, bottom, left.

    identifier: inset

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `inset` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `<length>`
        - `<percentage>`
        - `<top> <right>? <bottom>? <left>?`

    initial: auto

    appliesTo: Positioned components (position other than static).

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            inset: 0
        \\\
        ```
